      "title": "1. Router: admob_mediation, workflow",
      "description": "**The request:** *Create a mediation group for my rewarded ad units.*\n\nThe router picks `admob_mediation` and `PATH: workflow`, because this is multi-step and changes your account. Workflow means the stronger model role, with thinking on (tour 09)."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/nodes/specialist.py",
      "line": 620,
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 620,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 620,
          "character": 83
        }
      },
      "title": "2. First, reads",
      "description": "The model first calls read tools, like `accounts_adSources_list`. With Gemini, until a write happens, each pass is forced to call another tool instead of stopping to ask you (tour 09)."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/tools/registry.py",
      "line": 41,
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 41,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 41,
          "character": 17
        }
      },
      "title": "3. Then the write",
      "description": "The model calls `accounts_mediationGroups_create`. Its name ends in `_create`, so it's dangerous (tour 10)."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/nodes/tool_executor.py",
      "line": 437,
      "selection": {
