          "line": 472,
          "character": 43
        }
      },
      "title": "5. The run pauses",
      "description": "The approval is saved (temp file), the arguments are reshaped for the form, and `interrupt()` pauses the graph. Its state is already in Postgres (tour 11)."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/streaming/processor.py",
      "line": 191,
      "selection": {
