      },
      "title": "13. Result and answer",
      "description": "The `tool_result` shows on the card. The specialist confirms what was created, and the `result` event finishes the reply."
    },
    {
      "title": "The whole write path",
      "description": "### The whole write path\n\nRouter (`admob_mediation`, workflow) → specialist (reads first) → `accounts_mediationGroups_create` → dangerous → IDs checked → approval saved → `interrupt()` → card → your edits → `/chat/approve-tool` → `/chat/resume` → `Command(resume)` → tool executor again → edits checked → form→API → MCP → Google → result → answer.\n\n**Weak spots on this path:** no login check on approve, no ownership check on resume, and a page reload loses the resume. Know them before someone asks.\n\n**Next:** *21 - Interview prep*."
    }
  ]
